  "id": "self-feeding",
  "term": "self-feeding",
  "definition": "Self-feeding means obtaining one’s own food independently. In the historical source, it is used to describe a larval stage as distinct from an embryo, because the young organism must feed itself and therefore has functioning locomotor and digestive systems.",
